  (reviewed): the derive is `…|| true` so a no-match can never fail under set -e/pipefail, and if the
  label is unparseable the project.yml default is kept and the build proceeds unchanged — it can never
  break the deploy. Carries everything: rPPG fix, voice core, tap-to-type + sign keypad, keep-awake,
